{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/4e82cdea461a5dfef09eededa89174e9.poster.avif?t=1760634909\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/4e82cdea461a5dfef09eededa89174e9.webm?t=1760634909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/4e82cdea461a5dfef09eededa89174e9.mp4?t=1760634909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this humorous and unique simulation game, you take on the role of an unusual protagonist - a tree! Roam through an fresh town, stick to the schedule, experience the freedom of movement and explore a world that lies at your roots. But that's not all. As a tree, cause chaos and influence your surroundings in a whole new way.\u00a0Produce a lot of trouble in the city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Be a Tree in front of Jeffrey the T-Rex</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jeffrey lives alone and is therefore irritable. Jeffrey hates plants without effect and therefore attacks them, typical Jeffrey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/a658def0f4d79c6be5ecf2216cb7fba5.poster.avif?t=1760634909\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/a658def0f4d79c6be5ecf2216cb7fba5.webm?t=1760634909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/a658def0f4d79c6be5ecf2216cb7fba5.mp4?t=1760634909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Be a First Person Tree</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb buildings, discover hidden places and enjoy the unusual perspective of an urban environment. The demo offers a first insight into the special game mechanics that give you unimagined freedom and creative fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/c3e186f61d3954062d3f9aac88f58929.poster.avif?t=1760634909\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/c3e186f61d3954062d3f9aac88f58929.webm?t=1760634909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/c3e186f61d3954062d3f9aac88f58929.mp4?t=1760634909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Be immortalized as a Tree</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn to be immortalized as a tree forever by getting a name on a monument. Only real trees make it to the grave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/85e0580417d75d36e190a1b496c855ed.poster.avif?t=1760634909\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/85e0580417d75d36e190a1b496c855ed.webm?t=1760634909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/85e0580417d75d36e190a1b496c855ed.mp4?t=1760634909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to tear the city from its roots?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a tree, be, <strong>The Tree</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3054710?t=1760634909","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3054710?t=1760634909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/6c8f9421ceeb1d9beca8c7299213529a2bea9cf3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760634909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/6c8f9421ceeb1d9beca8c7299213529a2bea9cf3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760634909","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/4e82cdea461a5dfef09eededa89174e9.poster.avif?t=1760634909\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/4e82cdea461a5dfef09eededa89174e9.webm?t=1760634909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/4e82cdea461a5dfef09eededa89174e9.mp4?t=1760634909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this humorous and unique simulation game, you take on the role of an unusual protagonist - a tree! Roam through an fresh town, stick